{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Cbv/Main.html#Lean.Meta.Tactic.Cbv.cbvDecideGoal\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Cbv</span>.<span class=\"name\">cbvDecideGoal</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">m</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.MVarId\">MVarId</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Unit\">Unit</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Attempt to close a goal of the form `decide P = true` by reducing only the LHS using `cbv`.\n\n- If the LHS reduces to `Bool.true`, the goal is closed successfully.\n- If the LHS reduces to `Bool.false`, throws a user-friendly error indicating the proposition is false.\n- Otherwise, throws a user-friendly error showing where the reduction got stuck.\n","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Cbv/Main.html#Lean.Meta.Tactic.Cbv.cbvDecideGoal","kind":"def","line":467,"name":"Lean.Meta.Tactic.Cbv.cbvDecideGoal","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Cbv/Main.lean#L467-L495"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Cbv/Main.html#Lean.Meta.Tactic.Cbv.cbvGoal\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Cbv</span>.<span class=\"name\">cbvGoal</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">mvarId</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.MVarId\">MVarId</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.MVarId\">MVarId</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Reduce the goal target using call-by-value evaluation.\n\nPreprocesses the goal via `Sym.preprocessMVar` (instantiates metavariables, unfolds\nreducibles, shares common subterms), then reduces the goal type via `cbvCore`. If\nthe reduced type is `True`, the goal is closed. Otherwise, the target is replaced.\n\nAfter the reduction, attempts `refl` to close equation goals of the form `v = v`.\n","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Cbv/Main.html#Lean.Meta.Tactic.Cbv.cbvGoal","kind":"def","line":454,"name":"Lean.Meta.Tactic.Cbv.cbvGoal","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Cbv/Main.lean#L454-L465"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Cbv/Main.html#Lean.Meta.Tactic.Cbv.cbvHyp\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Cbv</span>.<span class=\"name\">cbvHyp</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">mvarId</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.MVarId\">MVarId</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">fvarId</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.FVarId\">FVarId</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.MVarId\">MVarId</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Reduce the type of hypothesis `fvarId` using call-by-value evaluation, in its own\n`SymM` session (like `conv at h => cbv`). The local context is only mutated after\nthe session ends, so the `SymM` incrementality invariant is preserved.\n","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Cbv/Main.html#Lean.Meta.Tactic.Cbv.cbvHyp","kind":"def","line":426,"name":"Lean.Meta.Tactic.Cbv.cbvHyp","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Cbv/Main.lean#L426-L452"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Cbv/Main.html#Lean.Meta.Tactic.Cbv.cbvGoalCore\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Cbv</span>.<span class=\"name\">cbvGoalCore</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">mvarId</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.MVarId\">MVarId</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/SymM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.SymM\">Sym.SymM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.MVarId\">MVarId</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Core of `cbvGoal`: reduces the target of an already preprocessed `mvarId` using\ncall-by-value evaluation, within the caller's `SymM` context.\n","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Cbv/Main.html#Lean.Meta.Tactic.Cbv.cbvGoalCore","kind":"def","line":397,"name":"Lean.Meta.Tactic.Cbv.cbvGoalCore","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Cbv/Main.lean#L397-L424"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Cbv/Main.html#Lean.Meta.Tactic.Cbv.cbvEntry\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Cbv</span>.<span class=\"name\">cbvEntry</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">e</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Simp/SimpM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.Simp.Result\">Sym.Simp.Result</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Reduce a single expression. Unfolds reducibles, shares subterms, then runs the\nsimplifier with `cbvPre`/`cbvPost`. Used by `conv => cbv`. ","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Cbv/Main.html#Lean.Meta.Tactic.Cbv.cbvEntry","kind":"def","line":380,"name":"Lean.Meta.Tactic.Cbv.cbvEntry","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Cbv/Main.lean#L380-L395"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">opaque</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Cbv/Main.html#Lean.Meta.Tactic.Cbv.cbv.maxSteps\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Cbv</span>.<span class=\"name\">cbv</span>.<span class=\"name\">maxSteps</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Options.html#Lean.Option\">Lean.Option</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Cbv/Main.html#Lean.Meta.Tactic.Cbv.cbv.maxSteps","kind":"opaque","line":114,"name":"Lean.Meta.Tactic.Cbv.cbv.maxSteps","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Cbv/Main.lean#L114-L117"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">opaque</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Cbv/Main.html#Lean.Meta.Tactic.Cbv.cbv.warning\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Cbv</span>.<span class=\"name\">cbv</span>.<span class=\"name\">warning</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Options.html#Lean.Option\">Lean.Option</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Cbv/Main.html#Lean.Meta.Tactic.Cbv.cbv.warning","kind":"opaque","line":109,"name":"Lean.Meta.Tactic.Cbv.cbv.warning","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Cbv/Main.lean#L109-L112"}}],"imports":["Lean.Meta.Sym","Lean.Meta.Sym.Simp.SimpM","Lean.Meta.Tactic.Assert","Lean.Meta.Tactic.Cbv.BuiltinCbvSimprocs.Array","Lean.Meta.Tactic.Cbv.BuiltinCbvSimprocs.Core","Lean.Meta.Tactic.Cbv.BuiltinCbvSimprocs.String","Lean.Meta.Tactic.Cbv.CbvEvalExt","Lean.Meta.Tactic.Cbv.CbvSimproc","Lean.Meta.Tactic.Cbv.ControlFlow","Lean.Meta.Tactic.Cbv.Opaque","Lean.Meta.Tactic.Cbv.TheoremsLookup","Lean.Meta.Tactic.Cbv.Util","Lean.Meta.Tactic.Refl","Lean.Meta.Tactic.Replace"],"instances":[],"name":"Lean.Meta.Tactic.Cbv.Main"}